  "decision_summary": "The evidence is mixed but leans positive: strong direct human CSF data from AZD3759 and moderate Kpuu values in related compounds support meaningful CNS access, while lapatinib and other analogs show poor normal-brain distribution. Low confidence due to modest similarity and conflicting erlotinib/lapatinib records.",
